=1 word added to personal dictionary.
% @spell snorepersonalword
=Found no misspelled words.
% @rmword snorepersonalword
=`snorepersonalword' removed from personal dictionary.

@wizard
; recycle(#100.spell_probe); delete_property(#100, "spell_probe"); return true;
true
